  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 4th level and every 4 levels thereafter, a thaumaturge gains a bonus feat. This may be spent to gain an extra magic talent, or any feat which has casting as a prerequisite (item creation feats, metamagic feats, Sphere Focus, Circle Casting, etc.).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/thaumaturge#toc20\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
